default wallpaper (components/luna-systemui/images/wallpaper.tar) ship as HP
released them. See Wallpaper_Image_LICENSE.txt inside the latter.

Changes in this repository
--------------------------

Everything needed to build HP's 2012 sources on a current Linux. Measured
against the hp-original tag: 206 of HP's files changed, 5,634 lines added and
486 removed. Beside them, and not inside anything of HP's, 28,512 lines we
wrote: the compatibility adapters under adapters/, the services HP never
released under services/, the SDK under sdk/ and the applications under apps/.
The scripts under tools/ and the tests under tests/ are ours as well. All of it
is contributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

The tag `hp-original` marks HP's imported code before any of those changes, so
`git diff hp-original` shows exactly what was modified and nothing else.

